}

// Material stress algorithm for structural collapse
function calculateStress(material, force) {
  // Calculate stress on the material based on applied force
}

// NPC pathfinding during combat scenarios
function updateNPCPathfinding(npc, playerPosition) {
  // Update NPC pathfinding based on the player's position
}
```

Regional A/B Testing and Adaptive Challenge Modes:
The game implements regional A/B testing of "adaptive challenge modes" using geofenced build variants with procedural escalation triggers masked as network latency compensation parameters. This allows for the testing and fine-tuning of gameplay difficulty based on player location and network performance.

Code Snippets:
```javascript
